target/
node_modules/
dist/
# What an app's phone builds write into a plugin: a copy of Tauri's own Kotlin
# library and Gradle's output in its android folder, and the Swift API beside
# the crate, which `ios/Package.swift` reads as `../.tauri/tauri-api`. Never
# part of the plugin, and cargo refuses to package a crate while they sit there
# untracked.
**/android/.tauri/
**/android/build/
crates/*/.tauri/
